                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "de8e0869-101b-3a9f-8953-e8cd2e8878ae",
                        "entry_id": "3fa6df11-dd93-3fa0-974b-de815f4cf675",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A wristwatch with electronic functionality beyond timekeeping."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "af207eed-ce14-3b4c-ab9b-a0530dcb0c00",
                        "entry_id": "3fa6df11-dd93-3fa0-974b-de815f4cf675",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A mobile device worn on the wrist with a touchscreen display."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "70cd3d33-98a4-4dc7-88b0-bfc0af069c22",
                                "sense_id": "af207eed-ce14-3b4c-ab9b-a0530dcb0c00",
                                "text": "Before too long, secure public key cryptosystems will make routine personal communications 100% secure. You'll use E-mail and digital voice, but since it's easy, you'll use security all the time. Your key will probably be stored in a smartcard or smartwatch that you carry with you. ... Will they have to do lightning raids on people they suspect to grab their computers while they are still on with the keys in ram? Rip your smartwatch off your wrist to get your code?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0818b69e-835f-49f6-bd0b-fe7ae398efb8",
                                "sense_id": "af207eed-ce14-3b4c-ab9b-a0530dcb0c00",
                                "text": "In Sydney, Australia, test trials are under way of a \"smart watch\" that can one day reduce the need for wallets and purses. ... Barnes stressed the trial with CTA is one of a number Swatch is undertaking with different suppliers to better adapt smart watches to local conditions and learn their potential."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "186913e8-678e-4f64-b92f-2bbb75004c66",
                                "sense_id": "af207eed-ce14-3b4c-ab9b-a0530dcb0c00",
                                "text": "I certainly hope Newton is not going to die, it is far superior to Windows CE. In fact I hope Apple will license the OS to all the makers of smartphones, smart cars, smart watches, smart ovens, etc."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1669cea-8d85-4f52-b9b4-e14a197ab404",
                                "sense_id": "af207eed-ce14-3b4c-ab9b-a0530dcb0c00",
                                "text": "Smartwatch buffs eagerly awaiting the arrival later this month of their Palm OS-based Fossil Wrist PDA are going to be disappointed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "701dafd1-ce69-4067-b750-33a6be3da75a",
                                "sense_id": "af207eed-ce14-3b4c-ab9b-a0530dcb0c00",
                                "text": "It's all in the wrist: E-ink smartwatch Pebble bags $2m"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ac47de23-d941-4149-8e79-5691335024d7",
                        "source_entry_id": "3fa6df11-dd93-3fa0-974b-de815f4cf675",
                        "source_sense_description": "wristwatch",
                        "target_lang_word": "smartwatch",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "smartwatch",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f28aa023-7a22-3523-b447-39517c601a26",
                                        "entry_id": "7c6d61c5-6054-3e21-b97f-551b425dca38",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "horloge met allerlei extra functies zoals het reageren op de mobiele telefoon en het meten van de hartslag en bloeddruk"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c817cc69-9d14-47b1-9941-fd5445362f3b",
                                                "sense_id": "f28aa023-7a22-3523-b447-39517c601a26",
                                                "text": "Het systeem kan worden uitgebreid met extra bedieningsmogelijkheden, waaronder het toestaan van bepaalde functies, zoals het bellen van het alarmnummer, of het toestaan van het doorgeven van kritieke gezondheidswaarschuwingen van een smartwatch, zoals bijvoorbeeld het meten van de hartslag. Het is nog niet bekend wanneer het apparaat op de markt zou kunnen komen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "56190191-d97c-4194-82d3-5e49b9210370",
